$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 4-(3,5-Dimethylphenoxy)benzoic Acid (25q). Prepared by heating a mixture
of KOH (189 mg, 2.9 mmol), 3,5-dimethylphenol (380 mg, 3.1 mmol), and
4-fluorobenzonitrile (333 mg, 2.7 mmol) in DMF (2 mL) to 175 °C in a
sealed tube for 20 min. The crude material from ether extraction was
refluxed in 50%H2SO4 (10 mL) and AcOH (5 mL) for 12 h. The product was
extracted with EtOAc (3 × 25 mL), washed with water then brine, dried
with Na2SO4, and concentrated. 641 mg (96%) of 25q. 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ 8.06
(d, 2H, J = 9.0 Hz), 6.99 (d, 2H, J = 9.0 Hz), 6.84 (s, 1H), 6.70 (s,
2H), 2.32 (s, 3H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM thermal (in stage 1), sealed tube used in stage 1
