$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of fluorophenylsulfone 10 (3.1 g, 8 mmol) in DMAC (20 mL)
were added Cs2CO3 (8.8 g, 27 mmol) and p-(trifluoromethoxy)phenol (2.1
mL, 16 mmol). The slurry was stirred at 95°C for 19 h. The reaction was
concentrated in vacuo. The residue was taken up in EtOAc, washed with
brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo.
Chromatography on silica eluting with EtOAc/ hexanes provided the
THP-protected hydroxamate 11j as a white foam (4.2 g, 96%). MS (ES+) MH+
calcd for C24H26NO8SF3, 546.14; found, 546.14.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Orally Active MMP-1 Sparing α-Tetrahydropyranyl and α-Piperidinyl Sulfone
Matrix Metalloproteinase (MMP) Inhibitors with Efficacy in Cancer,
Arthritis, and Cardiovascular Disease
